# Firo documentation is hand-formatted, not prettier-formatted.
#
# The `prettier` scripts in package.json pass --ignore-path=.eslintignore, so this
# is also the ignore path for `yarn test:other`. Our docs wrap prose at ~80 columns
# for terminal readability and use `*emphasis*`; prettier unwraps prose to a single
# line and rewrites `*emphasis*` to `_emphasis_`, which would produce a large diff
# unrelated to any content change.
#
# Style for these files is documented in docs/contributing/documentation.md.
docs/
README.md
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
NOTICE
